# One line-ending policy for the whole repository: every text file is stored AND checked out
# with LF on every OS (also with core.autocrlf=true). Binary files are auto-detected.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Byte-sealed files are never converted: GOLDEN.lock seals engine/tests/golden, the FX-71
# manifest seals shell/test/fixtures/fx71 (including recorded CRLF streams), and the
# engine/tests/fixtures binaries carry pinned digests (FX-46.zip, FX-24.hwp).
/engine/tests/golden/** -text
/engine/tests/fixtures/** -text
/shell/test/fixtures/fx71/** -text
